									"maxclass": "comment",
									"text": "Lp.zzz generates sequences of random values with 1/f distribution. The distribution of the values generated approximates a normal distribution in the range 0 <= x < 1 with an expected mean of 0.5. The important difference between this random generator and the others in the Litter Package is the sequence in which the numbers are generated: consecutive values will, in general, be close together. That is why the table window displays the sequence of random values, and not a histogram of the distribution.",
